## A year older

@cyra{emotion="sleepy"}: You came back. The moon remembers you. So do I, vaguely. I was asleep for part of it.
@pim{emotion="smug"}: Same moon cakes, same moth. New prices.
@cyra{emotion="happy"}: Stay for the moonrise. It's better the second time. You know what's coming, so you can watch the faces instead.
